 implementation. Core components include Corregedoria (internal governance and disciplinary matters), Ouvidoria (public complaints channel), Procuradoria (legal advisory and defense), and Auditoria (internal audit). These units operate within the Controle e Defesa block and function alongside the independent Conselho Nacional de Proteção de Dados Pessoais e da Privacidade, which provides advisory input and broad public participation for policy direction; the combination of these bodies creates a comprehensive governance architecture designed to balance accountability with operational efficiency [Data: Entities (290, 291, 292, 293, 289)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Public-private data sharing framework and value-generation paths\",\n      \"explanation\": \"The ANPD ecosystem formalizes data-sharing governance through a conceptual PARCERIAS_GERACAO unit, which represents partnerships and the generation of technical value, and defines two strategic paths: Caminho A (Ecosystem and Convênios, emphasizing international cooperation) and Caminho B (Comercialização Técnica, enabling monetization of expertise). These pathways reflect a dual objective of ecosystem-building and revenue-generation from know-how, and they tie into broader data governance via formal sharing rules and standards [Data: Entities (3); Data: Entities (7); Data: Entities (8)]. ANPD actively communicates with PARCERIAS_GERACAO to coordinate these value-generation activities within LGPD governance [Data: Relationships (2, 91)]. Additionally, the Ponte de Comunicacao serves as the official channel facilitating notifications and clarifications between ANPD, Controllers, Operators, Titulares, and DPOs, reinforcing the enforcement ecosystem’s connective tissue [Data: Entities (38); Data: Relationships (27)].\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"summary\": \"Scenario-based learning: Vazamento as a governance and risk exercise\",\n      \"explanation\": \"A central scenario, Cenário Vazamento Prefeitura (muni